(DATA RETENTION POLICY FOR MACHINE LEARNING) Tj T*
(Lumenfield Labs, Data Governance office. Version 3.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Purpose) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This policy defines how long the data used and produced by machine learning systems is kept,) Tj T*
(and how it is deleted.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Training data) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Raw training data is retained for 24 months after collection. After 24 months it is deleted) Tj T*
(from all storage locations, including backups, within the following 30 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Personal data is pseudonymized before it is used for training. The pseudonymization keys are) Tj T*
(stored separately and are accessible only to the Data Governance office.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
