(DATA RETENTION POLICY FOR MACHINE LEARNING \(continued\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Inference logs) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Inference logs, which contain model inputs and predictions, are retained for 90 days. After) Tj T*
(90 days they are aggregated into daily statistics and the individual records are deleted.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Model artifacts) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Model artifacts and their training metadata are kept in the model registry for 3 years) Tj T*
(after the model is retired, so that past predictions can be explained.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Deletion requests) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Requests from a person to delete their data are processed within 30 days. The person is) Tj T*
(informed when the deletion is complete.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
